## Key design compliance

1. **SDL from design §5** — appended verbatim. No `extend type`. All fields @aws_lambda.
2. **FormCompletion is SERVER-COMPUTED** — SQL COUNT over record_values joined to
   template_fields. Client receives {fieldsFilled, fieldsTotal, requiredMissing}.
   Test asserts the SQL references forms.record_values + forms.template_fields.
3. **saveFormRecordValues typed dispatch** — FIELD_TYPE_COLUMN map:
   text/textarea/select/radio/user → value_text, number → value_number,
   date → value_date, checkbox → value_bool, relation → value_uuid,
   multiselect → value_json. Upsert nulls all other columns on conflict.
4. **Immutability guard** — IMMUTABLE_STATUSES = {COMPLETE, APPROVED}.
   Negative test: write on complete → RECORD_IMMUTABLE + rollback + no upsert.
   Negative test: write on approved → same.
5. **Schema node dependency** — explicit comment in forms.ts header +
   all 10 resolvers added to schemaResource dependency list in api-stack.ts.
6. **SCHEMA-5** — tenantId from resolverContext only; test proves client-supplied
   tenantId in arguments is ignored.

